    }
  ],
  "snowdrake": [
    {
      "text": "* I ran away from home.\n* Why?",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* 'Cause my father was so\n  \"cold\" to me...",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* WHAT!?\n* It's a JOKE!!\n* LAUGH at it!!",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "snowdrakeAgain": [
    {
      "text": "* I really don't!\n* I don't care if he doesn't\n  like my jokes!",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "snowdrakeEnd": [
    {
      "text": "* Mom might have to share her\n  mind with other people now,\n  but she's still my mom.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* And that's \"cool!\"",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* 'Cause, uhh, we're made\n  of ice and stuff.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* WHAT!?!?\n* It's a JOKE!!\n* LAUGH at it!!",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "mother": [
    {
      "text": "* Sn... ow... y...",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "father": [
    {
      "text": "* The doctah.\n* She brought my wife.\n* Back from the dead.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* My son.\n* He seems happy again.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Our family.\n* It's biggah than evah.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Now that my wife.\n* Is combined.\n* With 16 othah people.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "fatherJob": [
    {
      "text": "* My boss stopped answering my\n  calls.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I don't know when my next\n  performance will be.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Maybe I shouldn't try to be\n  a comedian anymore...",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* It's tearing my family apart.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "fatherLost": [
    {
      "text": "* My son...\n* He was always making these\n  weird ice puns.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I hated them, so he ran\n  away from home...",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I think I should try to\n  patch things up with him.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Have you seen him?\n* Have you seen my son?",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "phoneRing": [
    {
      "text": "* (Ring... ring...)",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "phoneGaster": [
    {
      "text": "* hey.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "phoneQuestion": [
    {
      "text": "* is your refrigerator\n  running?",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "phoneYes": [
    {
      "text": "* nice.\n* i'll be over to deposit\n  the brewskis.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "phoneNo": [
    {
      "text": "* ok, i'll send someone\n  over to fix it.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* thanks for letting me\n  know.",
      "portrait": null,
